     <section id="privacy" class="privacy-section section-anchor" aria-labelledby="privacy-title"><div class="wrap privacy-layout"><div class="section-intro reveal"><p class="eyebrow">05 / YOUR OWN LITTLE SPACE</p><h2 id="privacy-title">Your money story.<br><em>Yours to keep.</em></h2><p>Some things are personal. Your money is one of them. TULLIP’s journal works locally on your device, with no account to create and no bank to connect.</p><div class="privacy-promises"><span>✓ No ads</span><span>✓ No analytics</span><span>✓ No cloud sync</span><span>✓ No sign-up</span></div><a href="#privacy-details" class="text-link">The plain-language details <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a></div><div class="pin-illustration reveal" aria-label="Illustration of TULLIP's optional six-digit app PIN, not a working lock"><span class="pin-flower" aria-hidden="true">✿</span><small>JUST BETWEEN YOU &amp; TULLIP</small><h3>Your private journal</h3><p>Your own six-digit TULLIP PIN.</p><div class="pin-dots" aria-hidden="true">● ● ● ● ● ●</div><div class="illustrated-keypad" aria-hidden="true"><span>1</span><span>2</span><span>3</span><span>4</span><span>5</span><span>6</span><span>7</span><span>8</span><span>9</span><span>♡</span><span>0</span><span>⌫</span></div><span class="sample-label">Design illustration · installed Android app only</span></div></div>[m
       <div id="privacy-details" class="wrap privacy-details section-anchor"><div><span>01</span><h3>A separate app PIN</h3><p>The optional TULLIP PIN is separate from your phone’s screen lock. It guards casual access when you leave or reopen the app. There is no account-based PIN recovery.</p></div><div><span>02</span><h3>You choose what leaves</h3><p>No automatic uploads. Share an export only when you choose. JSON backups hold records and receipt metadata; Android receipt image files need a separate private copy.</p></div><div><span>03</span><h3>Clear about the limits</h3><p>The journal database is not encrypted. Keep your device secure and backups private. Uninstalling or clearing app data can remove your local records.</p></div></div>[m
     </section>[m
