     <section id="faq" class="faq-section wrap section-anchor" aria-labelledby="faq-title"><div class="section-intro reveal"><p class="eyebrow">A FEW LITTLE ANSWERS</p><h2 id="faq-title">Good to <em>know.</em></h2><p>A gentle app should be easy to understand, too.</p></div><div class="faq-list reveal"><details><summary>Do I need an account or an internet connection?<span aria-hidden="true">＋</span></summary><p>No account is needed. Everyday journal features work offline on your device. You only need an internet connection to visit this website or download a build.</p></details><details><summary>Does TULLIP connect to my bank?<span aria-hidden="true">＋</span></summary><p>No. You record accounts, payment methods, income and expenses yourself. Wish jars set money aside within your journal; they do not move real money or make bank transfers.</p></details><details><summary>Can I take money back out of a wish jar?<span aria-hidden="true">＋</span></summary><p>Yes. Release part or all of a jar’s saved amount back to an account. Your history stays available, and releasing money is not recorded as new income.</p></details><details><summary>Is the app PIN the same as my phone PIN?<span aria-hidden="true">＋</span></summary><p>No. The new app lock uses a six-digit PIN you create for TULLIP. If you already enabled the older device-based lock, one verification of that existing protection is required to switch safely. Remember your TULLIP PIN: there is no reset bypass or recovery account.</p></details><details><summary>How do I keep a backup?<span aria-hidden="true">＋</span></summary><p>Use Settings to export a JSON backup and keep it somewhere private. Android receipt image files are separate from their JSON metadata and need their own private copy. Back up before updating, uninstalling or changing devices.</p></details><details><summary>Where can I download TULLIP?<span aria-hidden="true">＋</span></summary><p>Android testing builds will be shared through the project’s GitHub Releases page. No APK release is currently published. This website is a private preview; it does not install the app. See the download section for the current status.</p></details></div></section>[m
